  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_020 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) achieved 0.725 validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 (cheaper) and using avgpool aggregation (simpler than transformer) while keeping scvi_n200 RNA encoder. This balances exploration of cost-effective components with the successful multimodal multiprofile setup. Expected cost: ~2.8 GPU hours (resnet50 is less complex than vit_l, avgpool is simpler than transformer)."
}

